{
 "id": "ff393b28-1396-4302-9b72-9b223b419deb",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Miss Ghost, No Snuggling Please!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "女鬼小姐，禁止贴贴！"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Lan Ting, a Taoist, ended up meeting an ancient female ghost... And, out of nowhere, a bond of forbidden passion arose between them!\n\nThe little ghost won't stop clinging to her, asking for kisses and hugs, and even says that she \"smells so good\"?! How is it that a Taoist is always being bothered by a ghost?! Aren't you supposed to \"forget your earthly passions\", according to the Great Tao? Isn't having a forbidden romance with a ghost a problem?!\n\nLan Ting: \"Why are you running away? Weren't you the one who wanted to sleep with me?\"\nJiang Si (the ghost): \"Didn't you say that humans and ghosts are from different worlds and forbid physical contact?\""
  },
